{"title":"Noah Smith on L.A: fire lessons","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910777469/0/marginalrevolution~Noah-Smith-on-LA-fire-lessons.html","date":1736536150000,"content":"<p>The best piece I have seen so far, here is one bit:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Basically, the lessons I take away from the horrific L.A. fires are:</p></blockquote>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The insurance industry as we know it is in big trouble.</li>\r\n<li>Climate change is making wildfires worse, but there’s not much we can do about that right now.</li>\r\n<li>Forest management needs to get a lot more proactive, but is being blocked by regulation.</li>\r\n<li>Wildfire preparedness is just a lot more important than it used to be.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>And this:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Patrick Brown of the Breakthrough Institute <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://substack.com/redirect/5ecb6f4b-f762-47a0-907b-3f6d26d2cdfb?j=eyJ1IjoiNmc3N3YifQ.o5vzsFdJxuM1h9-cxhYnEIJl5uQa-l9E7gQ2m0qwXKQ\" target=\"_blank\">estimates</a> that in order to achieve the maximum economic benefit from wildfire suppression, California should be doing almost 4 times as much controlled burning as it currently aims to do, and almost 8 times as much as it’s currently doing. The gains over the last few years are welcome, but also woefully insufficient to the task.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.noahpinion.blog/p/learn-smart-lessons-from-the-la-fires\" target=\"_blank\">the entire essay</a>.  And this guy has a background in fires and forest management, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://outrageousfortune7.substack.com/p/the-la-fires-were-likely-not-caused-928\" target=\"_blank\">a good piece</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/noah-smith-on-l-a-fire-lessons.html\">Noah Smith on L.A: fire lessons</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/910777469/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/910777469/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/910777469/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/910777469/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/910777469/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/910777469/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/noah-smith-on-l-a-fire-lessons.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/noah-smith-on-l-a-fire-lessons.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a><h3>Related Stories</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/the-greenland-debates.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=the-greenland-debates\">The Greenland debates</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/my-podcast-with-reason.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=my-podcast-with-reason\">My podcast with Reason</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/lunar-spectrum-markets-in-everything.html?utm_source=rss&amp